<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94417" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑτοποι-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἀνάγκη ς</span>. the task
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of grinding and
			baking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				362
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>one that ground the corn in the hand-mill,
				miller.</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐκ τῶν μυλώνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λαμέδοντι σιτοποιῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					4.41
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίστειλον . . πόθεν δεῖ λαβόντα σῖτον
					καὶ πόσον δοῦναι Ἀμμωνίῳ τῷ ς. ὅπως ἑτοιμασθῇ
					σεμίδαλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMich.Zen.</u>
					28.32
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον σιτοποιοῦ</span>
			<i>bake-meats</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				40.17
			</span></i>; mostly fem., <i>baking-woman</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.150
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				4.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκες ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.187
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.78
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψοποιός</span> (a cook),
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				517e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.5.3
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάγειρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				23
			</span></i> (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				 i 304
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>).</div>
